description = Color([PAWN_nameDef] worked as a surgeon on a world mostly free of disease and human suffering, so [PAWN_possessive] job focused on elaborate and creative cosmetic surgeries. \n\n[PAWN_pronoun] understands human biology, deeply, but has never had to remove a tumour — or a bullet.)
slot = "Adulthood"
